  "strip": {
    "description": "How the roost graph lives on Buster Whack's single strip. There is no map screen: a roost is a tower (a wide, mostly safe arena with keeper and item tiles and a guard fight at its far edge), a link is a road leaving the tower's right edge, and the three rows are the exits. The road you arrived by is never offered, so a tower shows at most three exits.",
